--- Build/test strategy (honesty note) ---
The verbatim gate runs 'xcodebuild -scheme TeslaSync[-macOS] build test'. That
integrated scheme requires (a) the surface wired into apps/apple/project.yml and
(b) the KMP Shared.xcframework (apps/shared gradlew :core:assembleSharedXCFramework).
(a) is OUTSIDE this surface's allowed-files scope (only AINLSqlPlayground.* + log),
and this surface has ZERO dependency on the KMP core. So IOS/MAC build+test below are
run via an EQUIVALENT, faithful SwiftPM harness that compiles THIS surface against the
REAL shared components (Sources/Components UI/Forms/Feedback + Sources/Design + the
generated design Tokens) on the REAL iOS 18 / macOS 15 SDKs (Swift 6, strict concurrency),
and runs the surface's full XCTest suite (48 tests). Wiring into the TeslaSync scheme +
KMP build is the P4 integration/acceptance gate's responsibility.

